WEBVTT

00:24:58.621 --> 00:25:02.413
It was a bit scary and I must have
thought in that little four and

00:25:02.413 --> 00:25:07.038
a half year old mind will know hen will
lay an egg here. This is a scary place.

00:25:07.371 --> 00:25:12.996
So I went into an empty hen house and
waited and saw the egg come out.

00:25:13.579 --> 00:25:19.829
And you see, I had this enormous benefit
when I was a child of my mother.

00:25:19.996 --> 00:25:24.538
She was so supportive. So instead
of getting angry at me,

00:25:24.538 --> 00:25:27.913
how dare you go without telling us? Don't
you do it again? They called the police.

00:25:27.954 --> 00:25:33.038
By then, she said the wonderful story
of how a hen laid an egg.